   = help: the trait `EncodeBinary` is not implemented for `&'static [u8]`
   = note: `EncodeBinary` is sealed — extend by adding `impl EncodeBinary for ...` for the new type in `decode.rs` after extending the supported-OID matrix; downstream `impl EncodeBinary for ...` is forbidden by construction
   = help: the following other types implement trait `EncodeBinary`:
             &str
             bool
             i16
             i32
             i64
             u32
   = note: required for `&'static [u8]` to implement `ParamEncoder`
   = note: required for `(&'static [u8],)` to implement `ParamsWriter`
